{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22274","headline":"狂歌词 · 白居易","name":"狂歌词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明月照君席，白露沾我衣。\n劝君酒杯满，听我狂歌词。\n五十已後衰，二十已前痴。\n昼夜又分半，其间几何时。\n生前不欢乐，死後有余赀。\n焉用黄墟下，珠衾玉匣爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}